happen in the screenplay not because she would&nbsp;
get on that table and dance I see okay yeah so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:42.800
we're missing what would ever cause that if this&nbsp;
was truly what the characters would do okay yeah&nbsp;&nbsp;

